4. **Implement proper logging** - Only log the last 4 digits of card numbers, never the full PAN

**For Luhn validation (if needed for testing):**

```javascript
function validateLuhn(cardNumber) {
  const digits = cardNumber.replace(/\D/g, '');
  let sum = 0;
  let isEven = false;

  for (let i = digits.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
    let digit = parseInt(digits[i]);
    if (isEven) {
      digit *= 2;
      if (digit > 9) digit -= 9;
    }
    sum += digit;
    isEven = !isEven;
  }

  return sum % 10 === 0;
}
```

